//   {#IREF:n #M8:s #M5:s #M1:s #M2:s #M7:s #M3:d #M4:d #M6:d} @CURRENT("out");
//
//   /* what the circuit is: an OTA first stage, a common-source second stage M6/M7, the compensation RZ + CC, biased by a mirror of IREF */
